      "html": "<h3>One line</h3><p class=\"site-words\">Quickler turns your walk round a site into your finished report.</p>\n<h3>Short</h3><p class=\"site-words\">You walk the site and answer in WhatsApp, by voice note, text or photo. When you say done, Quickler writes the report from what you said and sent. You check it, change any word, and send it.</p>\n<h3>Longer</h3><p class=\"site-words\">The walk is quick. The report that follows is slow. Quickler closes that gap. You answer in WhatsApp as you go. Quickler writes your report from what you said and sent, with your photos in it. You check it, change any word, and send it. It is built in Scotland for people who inspect or keep records: care homes, nurseries, cleaning and facilities teams and more. One customer's write-up got 63% to 90% shorter, from 1 to 2 hours down to 12 to 22 minutes.</p>"
